# Sitecore Content SDK — Next.js (App Router)

**Primary:** [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) — compact guide (commands, structure, best practices, guardrails).

**Depth:** [.agents/docs/](.agents/docs/) — one layer file when needed (`[site]`/`[locale]`, proxy, next-intl, etc.). [README](.agents/docs/README.md) indexes layers.

**Optional:** [Skills.md](Skills.md) → one folder under [.agents/skills/](.agents/skills/) for the task. [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md) — layered reading. [.cursor/rules/](.cursor/rules/) — same rules as Cursor.

**Commands:** `npm install`, `npm run dev`, `npm run build`, `npm run lint`, `npm run type-check`. Copy `.env.example` → `.env.local`; never commit secrets.

**Product docs:** [Content SDK](https://doc.sitecore.com/xmc/en/developers/content-sdk/sitecore-content-sdk-for-xm-cloud.html)
